                <pb facs="0952" n="940" sameAs="frus:frus1937v01/pg940"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">561.35E1/352: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chairman of the American Delegation</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Davis</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-05-02T05:00:00+01:00">May 2, 1937—5 a.m.</date><lb/>[Received
                        10 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>31. The Drafting Committee circulated at midnight a complete draft agreement
                    together with a draft protocol not subject to ratifications designed to be
                    signed simultaneously with the agreement.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">signature.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
